OL,3,GNEWSADolly Parton stayed in trailer as
OL,4,Ahotel 'too fancy'
OL,5,
OL,6,FDolly Parton stayed in her own trailer
OL,7,Foutside an upmarket hotel as she did
OL,8,Fnot want staff to see her "washing her
OL,9,Ftights", a former music editor said.
OL,11,FTributes are being paid to the
OL,12,Flegendary country music star who has
OL,13,Fdied at the age of 80.
OL,15,FJade Wright interviewed Parton for the
OL,16,FLiverpool Echo ahead of her playing at
OL,17,Fthe city's arena in 2011, and said she
OL,18,Ftold her the Savoy Hotel in London was
OL,19,F"too fancy for me".
